chapter Voblint

session Voblint_Examples_Tooling in "." = "Voblint_Analysis_Interval" +
  description
    "Solver- and generator-layer witnesses, stated over whichever domain makes the
     effect visible rather than to demonstrate that domain"
  sessions
    "Voblint_Analysis_Sign"
  theories
    (* Generator-layer Side buffering: the buffered RHS generator terminates
       where issuing two Side writes per evaluation livelocks the solver. *)
